T*
(checkpoint on eager/no-cache. Training configurations intentionally have different learned functions and) Tj
T*
(are compared by task metrics, not by requiring cross-checkpoint token equality. If no serving candidate) Tj
T*
(passes, diagnostic extrema remain visible and explicitly ineligible. Existing FP16 custom attention is) Tj
T*
